[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"bf9d76e5-0ef6-46e1-bfe6-6a14327ce5b2","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h1 class=\"align-center\">ÜBER UNS</h1>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"5667752e-455d-4b21-b045-8a61d73d8e31","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h2 class=\"align-center\"><br>LACCICO – SCHNÜRSENKEL VOM SCHUHMACHER</h2>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"2c7619f4-707e-49f3-88c3-62d223a821df","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"d925e6d2-7ec8-444e-95c1-9ca71a3c5b8d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":""},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"6b3a02e4-f160-467c-9d56-617d7f32385a","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h2><strong>Warum wir das Einfache perfekt machen.</strong></h2>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"fb22344d-8afc-4313-8f5d-12f3aa408b29","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>LACCICO steht für Qualität, Tradition und europäische Handwerkskunst. Der Name verbindet das italienische <strong>„LACCI“</strong> (Senkel) mit dem Anspruch einer spezialisierten <strong>„CO“</strong> (Company). In Anlehnung an die italienische Phonetik wird der Name <strong>[ˈlatʃiko]</strong> ausgesprochen – mit der Betonung auf der ersten Silbe. Die Idee dazu entstand dort, wo das Handwerk zu Hause ist: auf unseren gemeinsamen Reisen durch die Werkstätten Italiens.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":1},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"ded75cc6-0a3a-460b-84d4-78fef1121ca5","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>Die Vision:</strong></h3><h3><strong>Die Brücke zwischen den Welten</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":2},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"d200a0aa-4fe4-4d36-a117-b63a8b5e0dd7","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Gemeinsam mit meiner Partnerin Annette – Künstlerin und Kirchenmusikerin mit einem feinen Gespür für Ästhetik und Rhythmus – fiel mir auf unseren Reisen die deutliche Diskrepanz in der Angebotsqualität auf. Während wir in Italien die Vorzüge hochwertiger, gewachster Senkel an edlem Schuhwerk bewunderten, bot der hiesige Zubehörhandel fast ausschließlich einfache, oft kurzlebige Massenware an.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":3},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"a1ac6e21-164e-4790-9930-c38b47107a00","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Inspiriert von der italienischen Hingabe zum Detail entschieden wir uns, diese Lücke zu schließen. Wir wollten die außergewöhnliche Qualität, die man sonst fast nur bei der Erstausstattung hochwertiger italienischer Schuhe findet, als verlässliches Zubehör exklusiv über unseren Direktvertrieb für jedermann zugänglich machen.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":4}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"6f3bfa81-27bd-4221-b4ad-73111fa3ea0a","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[3,9],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"3e971d9b-1bc5-4939-82e9-b5a73c91e41a","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/business-elegante-schuhe"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"0b83704e-4986-41ee-89ff-7e5850b6ecde","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"724","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"619eed4b-3d96-4476-9a14-46001a78f996","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[9,3],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"5a806d41-6b6e-4846-9aa1-c07c05f9f68a","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"738","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"2292b8cb-6f90-4aa5-b3be-cf013b76133f","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/laccico-finest-waxed-laces/info"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"5a349b9f-c2d5-4219-9b66-7ceef52277f1","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[3,9],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"8a590c49-b0e6-42e7-b32b-675b9761bf3b","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>Der Schuhmachermeister:</strong></h3><h3><strong>Expertise seit 1986</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"0b8234e1-31d7-4292-84b8-88fe3540c7f3","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p><br>Als gelernter Schuhmacher mit Meistertitel (erworben 1995) betrachte ich Schuhe nicht als Modeobjekt, sondern als Konstruktion. Seit Ende der 80er Jahre habe ich Dutzende Werkstätten, Gerbereien und Zulieferer in Europa intensiv kennengelernt. Ich weiß, wie Leder arbeitet und wie Druck im Schuh verteilt werden muss.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"597fd59d-d034-4baa-a5a4-2378dc444f84","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p><br></p><p>Dieses Wissen fließt in jede Auswahl unserer Produkte. Bei LACCICO gibt es keine Kompromisse: Ich prüfe jedes Los persönlich – mit dem geschulten Auge des Meisters und dem Griff des Handwerkers, der weiß, worauf es ankommt.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":2},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"0ae972f2-1fca-44a7-a681-d2f2d22f27d2","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"729","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"a55a4998-cb3a-4231-9249-198d52a5b2e7","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[9,3],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"929d8b1e-6e27-41b4-9344-ee243062b5f1","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"749","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"cd72168b-6dab-4861-828c-60acb398c9f4","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>Die Auswahl:</strong></h3><h3><strong>Europäische Allianz der Qualität</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"451033a4-817a-449e-9bfb-67a2d4838ed3","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Wir lassen dort fertigen, wo die Tradition der Flechtkunst lebt. In einer traditionsreichen <strong>„Trecchificio“</strong> (Flechterei) in der Toskana und in einem spezialisierten Partnerbetrieb in Polen entstehen unsere Senkel aus hochwertigen Garnen.</p><p>Das ist <strong>OEM-Qualität (Original Equipment Manufacturer)</strong>, wie sie von namhaften italienischen Schuhmarken für deren Erstausstattung gewählt wird. Nur ein kleiner Teil dieser exklusiven Ware erreicht den freien Markt – wir machen diese Qualität für Sie zugänglich.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":1}]},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"135cb5e0-8fb3-4ec6-b6bf-1ceddea376a1","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/form-durchmesser/rundsenkel-nach-durchmesser/rundsenkel-2-mm/r2-cs_286_1381"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}}},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"eb267da8-3440-475c-9439-78cabfdc9662","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"386e0c50-a943-481c-afd6-c5f98a76b295","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>Unsere Philosophie:</strong></h3><h3><strong>Das Detail entscheidet</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"4f7ecce9-b3d1-4322-b2d9-a8968ce1ee0d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Ein LACCICO Senkel ist ein durchdachtes Accessoire. Er muss reißfest sein, aber geschmeidig bleiben. Er muss glänzen und trotzdem griffig sein. Durch die spezielle Wachsung und die dichte Konstruktion des Geflechts bieten wir ein Produkt, das altert wie ein guter Schuh: mit Charakter und Würde.</p><p>Wir laden Sie ein, den Unterschied zu spüren. Denn Perfektion beginnt dort, wo andere aufhören hinzusehen – beim Schnürsenkel.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"Carousel","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"7a72aad4-c63e-4db9-b10d-2ff0c12988d8","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"controls":{"color":"#000000","displayArrows":true},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"909b5a18-41c1-4a94-8e90-59a9d64ca095","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/fronte